 it that took my virginity again?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of Miyuki and a neighbor of the protagonist, who he thinks of as an older childhood friend. She's currently attending a university in her hometown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having an uninhibited personality, she was always having Shuuto under her thumb. She's always teasing Shuuto, but on the contrary, she actually likes him as a man. As she's inexperienced when it comes to love, she still hasn't expressed her feelings, but before Shuuto left for Tokyo, she teased him like always, seduced him and eventually took his virginity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Even after the protagonist left for Tokyo, she still loves him. She knows that Shuuto admires her mother Miyuki, and is jealous of the fact."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Has an F-cup breasts, which is fairy large, but is the smallest among the main heroines. However, she boasts the freshest body proportions compared to Iori and Miyuki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Official Site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c49322"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美雪の娘。お隣さんで、主人公にとって年上の幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在、実家から地元にある大学に通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"奔放な性格で昔から主人公を振り回してきた。なにかとちょっかいをかけてくるが、それは好意の裏返しで、秋人のことを異性として好いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛は不得手かつ未経験なため、いまだにその気持ちを素直に伝えられないでいるが、秋人が東京に引っ越す前に、いつものノリでからかうように秋人を誘惑し、秋人の童貞を奪った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"秋人が東京に引っ越した後も、一途に秋人のことを想っていて、母親である美雪に、秋人が憧れているのをあまり快く思っていない（ヤキモチ）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸はＦカップとかなり大きいが、メインの中では一番控えめ。ただし、伊桜里、美雪よりも瑞々しくプロポーションは優れている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9802","sourceWorkId":"23805","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"美雪の娘。 主人公にとって年上の幼なじみで、地元の大学に通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"奔放な性格で昔から主人公を振り回してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは好意の裏返しで、秋人を異性として好いているが、気持ちは伝えられていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"秋人が東京へ引っ越す際には、いつものノリでからかうように誘惑して童貞を奪った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後も一途に秋人を想っていて、母親に秋人が憧れているのを快く思っていない（ヤキモチ）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今さらなに言ってるのよ。 あたしたちセックスまでした仲じゃない。 あたしの処女奪ったのは誰だっけ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"46886"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9802","sourceWorkId":"23805","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"f","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9802","sourceWorkId":"23805","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9802","sourceWorkId":"23805","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9802","sourceWorkId":"23805","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9802","sourceWorkId":"23805","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa04b06001f641540625d720f580c7f43cdbf7c57aaa673294a818dc809e66af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45052948f76575b5441d59a09220b6129d67c3bf9fa2091f84f7691a5cdd3e70.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前田恵","creatorId":"vndb:s11","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11","name":"前田 恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:185492:46886:8580:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c49323","characterName":"三笠 栞","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"46887","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"185492"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9803"],"vndbCharacterId":"c49323"},"originalCharacterName":"三笠 栞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"n